# NON1ASED.V19_CC_noHostXT subset for jax-snana parity tests
# Cropped phase × wavelength grid.
#
# 835, 836 and 501 reuse 834's SED file under different catalogue indices.
# Template assignment and the NON1A/PEC1A split are index-driven, so exercising
# them needs entries in both classes, not distinct SEDs. Runs naming only 834
# are unaffected.

NON1A:  834  IIn    pycoco_SN2008fq_noHostCorr.SED
NON1A:  835  IIn    pycoco_SN2008fq_noHostCorr.SED
NON1A:  836  IIn    pycoco_SN2008fq_noHostCorr.SED
PEC1A:  501  IaT    pycoco_SN2008fq_noHostCorr.SED
